cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying dataset, please cite this repository."
title: "orchard-lidar-seg"
abstract: "Code and annotated point cloud dataset for full-scene semantic segmentation and tree-trunk instance segmentation in standardized orchard scenes, collected with a VLP-16 multi-line LiDAR. The dataset contains 9 annotated classes over 20 sequences (1779 frames) in KITTI / SemanticKITTI format."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/liqiujie2/orchard-lidar-seg"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"

